{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05310","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 王景","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉辇移中禁，珠梯览四禅。\n重阶清汉接，飞窦紫霄悬。\n缀叶披天藻，吹花散御筵。\n无因銮跸暇，俱舞鹤林前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王景","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}